# FIELD-BARN-4: a varied meadow on FIELD_Barn from Grass Type assets - wildflowers and tussocks grow in patches
# (each variety's own noise mask, as UE's landscape grass output with a noise term), no rows, no repeating pattern;
# and no pale grass cell with a hard edge (seen in FOLIAGE-PROOF scn-1028-094318 1_field_grass, lower left).
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 70
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_field_grass the meadow by the barn has patches of yellow wildflowers and of tall tussocks among the blades, no rows, no repeating pattern; no pale cell with a straight edge
# Low over the meadow: the flowers and tussocks read at the feet.
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -600,250,1800
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.2,-0.35,-1
Тогда-вид 1b_field_low flower heads and tussocks in clusters with open blade lawn between them
# From above: the whole near field at once.
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,3500,3200
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,-0.55
Тогда-вид 2_field_high seen from above the grass has no pale square with a hard edge; flower patches are irregular blobs, not a grid
